WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.001 --> 00:00.873
(All characters, locations, and events are fictional

3
00:00.898 --> 00:01.801
and for entertainment purposes only.

4
00:01.826 --> 00:02.785
No actions depicted are intended to be encouraged or endorsed.

5
00:02.810 --> 00:03.928
Animals were specially trained and supervised by professionals.

6
00:03.952 --> 00:05.000
Viewer discretion is advised.)

7
00:12.902 --> 00:15.578
The difference between winners and losers

8
00:15.603 --> 00:18.364
isn't who can hit the ball farther,

9
00:18.389 --> 00:22.590
but who can stay focused and steady on the crucial shots.

10
00:24.491 --> 00:27.225
Golf isn't a game of perfection.

11
00:27.250 --> 00:30.371
It's a game of accepting our mistakes.

12
00:30.396 --> 00:33.462
We may practice our swings hundreds of times,

13
00:33.969 --> 00:36.433
but the moment the clubface hits the ball,

14
00:37.270 --> 00:39.316
all that matters is keeping calm.

15
00:42.567 --> 00:44.386
And no matter what happens,

16
00:44.411 --> 00:47.111
we have to keep moving on to the next hole

17
00:47.136 --> 00:48.627
until the game is over.

18
00:51.973 --> 00:58.240
(Pro Praew Pattharaporn Sriphatprasit)

19
01:04.091 --> 01:07.617
♪ Everyone can tell by the way you stare ♪

20
01:08.086 --> 01:09.980
♪ Sneaking little looks when I'm unaware ♪

21
01:10.005 --> 01:13.752
♪ It's plain to see ♪

22
01:13.777 --> 01:15.754
♪ I know exactly what you think of me ♪

23
01:15.778 --> 01:19.279
♪ First to watch my stories every time ♪

24
01:19.583 --> 01:21.583
♪ You remember every fave of mine ♪

25
01:21.608 --> 01:25.118
♪ Everywhere I go, you're by my side ♪

26
01:25.374 --> 01:27.374
♪ Don't tell me there's nothing on your mind ♪

27
01:27.399 --> 01:30.268
♪ So when are you gonna say the words? ♪

28
01:30.293 --> 01:32.230
♪ Don't keep me waiting till it hurts ♪

29
01:32.255 --> 01:35.050
♪ The way you act, I know you're into me ♪

30
01:35.075 --> 01:37.918
♪ That racing heart gives you away so easily ♪

31
01:37.943 --> 01:41.780
♪ But I'll play clueless, just wait and see ♪

32
01:41.805 --> 01:43.805
♪ I wanna hear you say it to me ♪

33
01:43.830 --> 01:46.595
♪ Giving me signs, so why still wait? ♪

34
01:46.620 --> 01:50.026
♪ You know I'm into you, I bet ♪

35
01:50.051 --> 01:54.785
♪ How long will you keep playing so tough? ♪

36
01:54.810 --> 01:56.817
♪ Or should I be the one to call your bluff? ♪

37
01:58.654 --> 02:00.544
Ms. Fahsai told me

38
02:00.569 --> 02:02.912
that everything you've done for me

39
02:02.937 --> 02:04.771
was just to charm me

40
02:04.796 --> 02:06.599
because you wanted to use me.

41
02:06.624 --> 02:09.185
But I don't believe that.

42
02:09.210 --> 02:11.793
I just want to hear you say that's not true.

43
02:11.818 --> 02:13.818
I would never do that to you.

44
02:14.271 --> 02:16.940
You know how real what we have is.

45
02:16.965 --> 02:18.785
And I think that's a good thing.

46
02:18.810 --> 02:21.572
It's a chance for me to reconnect with my feelings.

47
02:22.399 --> 02:24.552
The only player who can truly match Pro Jin

48
02:24.577 --> 02:26.831
is probably Pro Vee from Goodview.

49
02:26.856 --> 02:28.771
Win the All Star championship.

50
02:28.796 --> 02:30.392
By any means necessary.

51
02:30.417 --> 02:33.424
Of course. We have to win this match.

52
03:10.830 --> 03:13.565
"I saw you were still asleep, so I left first.

53
03:13.590 --> 03:15.590
See you at the course, Your Vee."

54
03:36.509 --> 03:37.818
- Hello. - Hi.

55
03:46.398 --> 03:47.731
Ugh, where did Nana go?

56
03:48.137 --> 03:49.615
I haven't seen her since I got here.

57
03:53.530 --> 03:57.108
Nut, something's happened.

58
03:57.364 --> 04:00.783
The announcer we hired isn't answering any of our calls.

59
04:00.808 --> 04:03.345
And the event starts in ten minutes.

60
04:03.370 --> 04:05.554
- Oh. - Does Nana know?

61
04:05.797 --> 04:08.175
I haven't seen Miss Nana since this morning.

62
04:18.181 --> 04:19.785
There she is.

63
04:20.650 --> 04:23.420
Whoa, where have you been?

64
04:25.649 --> 04:28.674
- Miss Nana, there's something... - I already know.

65
04:28.748 --> 04:31.454
It's nothing major. Every problem has a solution.

66
04:37.842 --> 04:41.472
Hello! Welcome to Goodview Golf Club.

67
04:43.710 --> 04:47.964
Oh, thank you, March, for the shrimp soup you sent me.

68
04:48.767 --> 04:50.619
Did you come to see who wins today,

69
04:50.644 --> 04:53.740
or to see which of your plans falls apart next?

70
04:57.866 --> 04:59.945
And about your plan this morning,

71
04:59.970 --> 05:01.995
I don't think it was yours, March,

72
05:02.020 --> 05:05.379
Because it was... baby stuff!

73
05:05.897 --> 05:08.222
Oops, someone's calling.

74
05:10.216 --> 05:11.464
What the hell?

75
05:24.019 --> 05:25.058
Oops!

76
05:38.771 --> 05:40.171
Is that all you've got?

77
05:43.883 --> 05:44.930
Whoa!

78
05:48.831 --> 05:50.458
Guess this counts as my morning workout.

79
05:54.837 --> 05:55.939
Nice try.

80
06:03.942 --> 06:04.960
Oh!

81
06:06.492 --> 06:07.516
Huh!

82
06:09.122 --> 06:10.233
You're still not done?

83
06:15.063 --> 06:16.646
How am I supposed to get past this one?

84
06:22.254 --> 06:23.380
Here goes nothing.

85
06:34.106 --> 06:36.388
What movie did whoever planned this watch?

86
06:36.397 --> 06:39.120
That's such a childish plan.

87
06:43.842 --> 06:44.897
You're pretty good.

88
06:56.974 --> 06:59.317
The event looks amazing, Nana.

89
07:01.551 --> 07:02.979
Thank you, Auntie.

90
07:03.474 --> 07:06.142
See? This is exactly what I was telling you.

91
07:06.167 --> 07:08.621
- I could retire tomorrow. - Mm-hmm.

92
07:10.223 --> 07:13.465
Uh, but Miss Nana, about the announcer...

93
07:15.006 --> 07:17.281
I'll have to ask you to fill in, Nut.

94
07:17.306 --> 07:18.973
But don't worry about being lonely.

95
07:18.998 --> 07:20.724
I've already asked Chef Queen

96
07:20.749 --> 07:22.597
to help you with the commentary, too.

97
07:22.756 --> 07:23.772
Oh...

98
07:25.525 --> 07:28.452
Sure. Then I'll go get ready.

99
07:29.319 --> 07:31.350
I'll leave things here to Belle.

100
07:31.574 --> 07:32.797
Of course.

101
07:32.979 --> 07:34.503
- Excuse me. - Sure.

102
07:52.595 --> 07:56.844
Hello, everyone, and welcome to

103
07:56.869 --> 08:00.450
the All Star Women's Golf Championship.

104
08:00.475 --> 08:02.413
Featuring the finest female golfers

105
08:02.438 --> 08:05.016
from the country's top golf clubs,

106
08:05.041 --> 08:08.956
all vying for a title that's more than just a championship.

107
08:14.715 --> 08:16.807
And now, let me introduce

108
08:16.832 --> 08:20.588
the players competing in today's tournament.

109
08:20.782 --> 08:26.036
First up, Pro Pop, Ploychompoo, from Sky Valley Golf Club.

110
08:29.236 --> 08:35.546
And next, Pro Kaimook, Yanisa, from The Blue Lake Golf Course.

111
08:39.278 --> 08:43.701
Pro Sherry, Tiranan, from Legacy V Golf Club.

112
08:45.798 --> 08:51.033
And next, Pro Meiji, Jenjira, from Golden Hill.

113
08:52.619 --> 08:57.302
Pro Satang, Kornkamol, from Angel Golf Country Club.

114
08:58.458 --> 09:03.793
And next, Pro Wine, Nattagate, from Royal Horizon Golf Links.

115
09:04.410 --> 09:10.552
And finally, Pro Jin, Jintaphat, from The Royal Green.

116
09:11.598 --> 09:13.181
I don't like leaving things to chance.

117
09:13.733 --> 09:16.838
I want to know for certain, before you even compete,

118
09:16.863 --> 09:18.222
that you're going to win.

119
09:18.247 --> 09:21.541
This is a ball drop device. Just strap it to your ankle.

120
09:21.566 --> 09:24.022
And this is a rangefinder I modified myself.

121
09:24.047 --> 09:26.047
You can use its slope mode.

122
09:26.820 --> 09:28.645
Don't forget to wear long pants tomorrow.

123
09:29.094 --> 09:30.629
So you can hide the device.

124
09:47.450 --> 09:49.263
Don't worry, Ms. Yupadee.

125
09:49.288 --> 09:51.548
Pro Jin won't use the ball drop device. But we still...

126
09:51.573 --> 09:53.414
Pro Jin told me to return it to you, Mr. March.

127
09:55.723 --> 09:56.730
Why?

128
09:57.657 --> 10:00.020
She said she'll use her own rangefinder.

129
10:00.045 --> 10:02.300
She tried this one, but couldn't see through it.

130
10:02.325 --> 10:03.625
Couldn't see through it?

131
10:05.293 --> 10:06.416
Looks fine to me.

132
10:07.329 --> 10:10.200
Pro Jin said she couldn't see the future with it.

133
10:10.225 --> 10:11.494
And when she adjusted the slope mode,

134
10:11.519 --> 10:13.177
it made a suspicious sound.

135
10:13.201 --> 10:14.973
So she told me to return it.

136
10:19.376 --> 10:21.179
Pro Jin's pretty crafty, isn't she?

137
10:21.973 --> 10:24.777
And your plan isn't scary at all.

138
10:25.329 --> 10:27.321
It's actually pretty funny now.

139
10:28.068 --> 10:29.490
What other plans do you have?

140
10:30.535 --> 10:31.725
Of course I have more.

141
10:32.835 --> 10:33.897
Just wait and see.

142
10:46.555 --> 10:49.488
And finally, representing our very own course,

143
10:49.513 --> 10:54.037
Pro Venus from Goodview Golf Club!

144
10:54.708 --> 10:58.251
(Pro Venus - Goodview Golf Club)

145
11:01.882 --> 11:04.971
- Pro Vee! Pro Vee... - Pro Vee! Pro Vee...

146
11:06.081 --> 11:08.817
(Pro Venus - Goodview Golf Club)

147
11:17.551 --> 11:20.013
(Pro Venus - Goodview Golf Club)

148
11:27.930 --> 11:33.100
I hope you won't pull any more dirty tricks like you did before.

149
11:34.710 --> 11:38.381
I assure you, I won't do anything like that.

150
11:38.789 --> 11:41.725
Wow, and here's the official opening shot

151
11:41.750 --> 11:43.750
to kick off the tournament!

152
11:44.098 --> 11:46.845
Today's competition will be divided into two groups.

153
11:46.870 --> 11:49.855
Group A has four players, and Group B has four.

154
11:49.880 --> 11:52.716
Group A will start on Hole 1,

155
11:52.741 --> 11:55.465
while Group B will start on Hole 10.

156
11:55.664 --> 11:57.816
They'll play through all 18 holes.

157
11:57.841 --> 12:01.462
But Nat, why don't we all start on Hole 1 together?

158
12:01.570 --> 12:04.538
It's simple. With a two-tee start,

159
12:04.563 --> 12:08.065
both groups can finish almost at the same time.

160
12:08.150 --> 12:10.436
Since they can start playing simultaneously,

161
12:10.461 --> 12:13.024
neither group has to wait for the other to start.

162
12:13.049 --> 12:14.726
Then the other group follows behind.

163
12:14.751 --> 12:18.100
Oh, I see. So the scoreboard will show everyone's current score,

164
12:18.125 --> 12:19.863
so we can see who's leading.

165
12:19.888 --> 12:22.451
And we'll get to see the winner right in front of us, right?

166
12:22.476 --> 12:23.949
- Exactly. - Wow!

167
12:23.974 --> 12:26.733
Let's take a look at the opening shots.

168
12:32.225 --> 12:35.759
(Pro Venus)

169
12:42.688 --> 12:45.912
Wow, what a beautiful opening shot, Pro Venus!

170
14:11.701 --> 14:13.655
That was an incredible shot!

171
14:23.403 --> 14:25.582
Pro Jin is going aggressive with this shot,

172
14:25.607 --> 14:26.847
taking a bold risk.

173
14:26.872 --> 14:30.308
The players are all very close on the leaderboard right now.

174
14:45.886 --> 14:49.129
If this ball reaches the green, she'll have a shot at eagle.

175
14:53.456 --> 14:56.623
Wow, what a beautiful opening shot, Pro Venus!

176
14:57.727 --> 14:58.956
That's tough.

177
15:00.759 --> 15:02.017
Oh, wow!

178
15:29.827 --> 15:31.487
Beautifully done!

179
15:31.512 --> 15:34.369
That shot puts Pro Jin in the lead.

180
15:50.603 --> 15:52.961
- Wow, great shot! - What a shot!

181
15:58.647 --> 15:59.835
It's incredibly close.

182
15:59.860 --> 16:01.756
Yes, Nut. It's really heating up.

183
16:01.781 --> 16:04.613
No one's giving an inch right now.

184
16:22.799 --> 16:24.996
- Wow! - Whoa!

185
16:25.021 --> 16:27.021
- What happened? - Pro Vee missed that shot.

186
16:27.046 --> 16:28.608
What a shame.

187
16:31.913 --> 16:33.784
Now there are only four holes left.

188
16:33.809 --> 16:36.848
We'll have to see if Pro Vee can make up the gap

189
16:36.873 --> 16:38.786
and catch the leader, Pro Jin. - Yes.

190
16:38.810 --> 16:41.068
Shall we recap the scores so far?

191
16:41.093 --> 16:42.554
Of course, Nat.

192
16:42.579 --> 16:46.571
Currently in first place is Pro Jin from Group B,

193
16:46.596 --> 16:48.840
representing The Royal Green.

194
16:48.865 --> 16:53.134
In second place is Pro Kaimook, also from Group B,

195
16:53.174 --> 16:55.960
representing Woodview Golf Club.

196
16:55.985 --> 16:57.814
Followed by Pro Wine,

197
16:57.839 --> 17:00.568
from Thai Silver Country Club.

198
17:00.593 --> 17:05.315
And in fourth place is Pro Vee from Goodview Golf Club.

199
17:05.340 --> 17:08.035
But it's still too early to call.

200
17:08.060 --> 17:10.863
In golf, anything can happen.

201
17:10.888 --> 17:12.850
We have to wait until Hole 18

202
17:12.875 --> 17:16.273
before we know who's truly the best today.

203
17:16.298 --> 17:18.483
Oh, this is getting intense, everyone!

204
17:42.410 --> 17:44.049
Don't get too confident yet.

205
17:44.350 --> 17:46.779
Pro Vee is closing the gap.

206
17:48.039 --> 17:49.254
Don't worry.

207
17:49.785 --> 17:51.103
She'll never catch up.

208
17:54.171 --> 17:56.404
Has anyone ever told you

209
17:56.429 --> 17:59.436
your greatest strength is knowing how to talk?

210
17:59.864 --> 18:02.386
But your weakness is that talk is all you do.

211
18:03.362 --> 18:05.420
Hurry up and make me believe

212
18:05.445 --> 18:08.790
our course will win before we reach Hole 18.

213
18:10.942 --> 18:12.022
Yes, ma'am.

214
18:52.298 --> 18:55.545
Here's the situation. Pro Vee has a chance at eagle,

215
18:55.570 --> 18:58.381
while Pro Jin needs to save par.

216
19:14.046 --> 19:16.074
Do you have a plan to close this out?

217
19:16.582 --> 19:17.719
Of course.

218
19:31.037 --> 19:32.203
Pick up, damn it!

219
19:34.025 --> 19:35.175
Why aren't you answering?

220
19:36.666 --> 19:37.782
Pick up!

221
19:52.146 --> 19:54.314
Oh, no! Who's dead now?

222
19:54.339 --> 19:55.831
There's an ambulance here now,

223
19:55.856 --> 19:58.078
and it's really distracting the players.

224
19:58.103 --> 20:00.995
Officials, could you please check what's happening?

225
20:15.654 --> 20:17.069
This is your plan?

226
20:19.236 --> 20:21.548
Well? What do you think of my plan?

227
20:21.871 --> 20:24.320
It's obviously the plan of a pathetic crook.

228
20:40.691 --> 20:42.668
It's not as close as it should be.

229
20:42.693 --> 20:45.869
I think the next shot will be quite a pressure shot.

230
20:45.894 --> 20:49.929
Oh, this is so nerve-racking! I can hardly breathe!

231
20:49.954 --> 20:51.722
Let's see how this plays out.

232
20:55.126 --> 20:59.413
And now we've finally reached the decisive hole.

233
20:59.438 --> 21:03.064
This is so exciting! We've made it to the 18th hole.

234
21:03.089 --> 21:05.674
It looks like several players still have a chance, right?

235
21:05.699 --> 21:08.741
Absolutely. The final hole is a par 5.

236
21:08.766 --> 21:11.369
- Pro Jin is leading at -13. - Yes.

237
21:11.394 --> 21:14.509
Pro Vee is just one stroke behind at -12,

238
21:14.533 --> 21:17.378
while Pro Pop is only two strokes behind.

239
21:17.403 --> 21:19.881
Oh, my! What could happen with scores like these?

240
21:20.210 --> 21:22.767
If Pro Jin makes par on this hole,

241
21:22.792 --> 21:24.204
she'll win the championship outright.

242
21:24.229 --> 21:25.277
Oh, my God!

243
21:25.301 --> 21:28.366
As for Pro Vee, she needs at least a birdie

244
21:28.391 --> 21:30.509
to have a chance. Just a chance.

245
21:30.797 --> 21:33.872
But to take the lead and beat Pro Jin outright,

246
21:33.897 --> 21:36.129
she needs nothing less than an eagle.

247
21:36.154 --> 21:39.892
Oh, my God! Everyone, let's see how this plays out!

248
21:55.193 --> 21:58.422
Pro Jin remains calm, sticking to her game plan.

249
22:17.249 --> 22:21.080
Oh, no! It's not going in!

250
22:21.105 --> 22:24.162
It's not going in! Not this time!

251
22:28.936 --> 22:30.974
Pro Jin just missed it.

252
22:30.999 --> 22:33.658
That puts Pro Jin at -12,

253
22:33.683 --> 22:35.049
putting her behind.

254
22:35.074 --> 22:36.994
Pro Vee now has a chance to take the lead.

255
22:50.091 --> 22:52.019
That's why I wanted you to compete again, Vee.

256
22:52.044 --> 22:53.886
Don't let your whole life

257
22:53.910 --> 22:56.467
end at that 18th hole, Vee.

258
22:59.035 --> 23:02.776
What is your heart telling you to do right now?

259
23:03.810 --> 23:05.397
And who are you doing it for?

260
24:11.959 --> 24:13.276
Unbelievable!

261
24:13.301 --> 24:15.774
Pro Vee turns it around on the final hole,

262
24:15.799 --> 24:18.928
edging out Pro Jin by just one stroke!

263
24:18.953 --> 24:20.867
Amazing! Amazing!

264
24:20.892 --> 24:23.454
Pro Vee did it! She did it!

265
24:23.479 --> 24:27.475
With a score of -13, while Pro Jin finishes at -12,

266
24:27.500 --> 24:29.748
losing by the narrowest of margins!

267
24:44.378 --> 24:45.696
Oh, my God!

268
24:45.735 --> 24:46.693
That was so intense!

269
24:46.718 --> 24:48.697
They were neck and neck all 18 holes.

270
24:48.729 --> 24:49.910
It was so close.

271
24:49.935 --> 24:51.987
- Yeah. - She even had the advantage.

272
24:52.012 --> 24:55.795
I can't stop smiling. She's amazing. Oh, my God!

273
25:02.330 --> 25:03.568
You were amazing.

274
25:12.736 --> 25:14.169
Congratulations, my friend.

275
25:17.259 --> 25:20.261
Thank you. You played really well today.

276
25:21.325 --> 25:24.273
But I guess it wasn't enough to beat you.

277
25:25.746 --> 25:28.150
And about what happened that day...

278
25:29.280 --> 25:30.954
I don't think we need to talk about it anymore.

279
25:31.786 --> 25:36.159
Because today made it clear who the winner is.

280
25:36.878 --> 25:39.497
As for the past, let it stay there.

281
25:40.155 --> 25:41.856
I'm not going to carry it anymore.

282
25:42.539 --> 25:45.527
And as for our friendship...

283
25:46.626 --> 25:49.141
The friendship that ended that day...

284
25:49.879 --> 25:51.233
I guess we'll just have to give it time.

285
25:52.542 --> 25:55.852
But I believe... it'll find its way back to us.

286
25:58.042 --> 25:59.420
Congratulations, my friend.

287
26:22.920 --> 26:25.957
Congratulations. You both played beautifully.

288
26:27.579 --> 26:30.748
Losing today doesn't mean you'll lose forever.

289
26:35.071 --> 26:36.993
Winning today wasn't easy either, was it?

290
26:41.906 --> 26:46.145
Congratulations to Goodview on becoming an Asian Tour venue.

291
26:46.938 --> 26:48.020
Thank you.

292
26:48.666 --> 26:52.414
Facing a stronger opponent only pushes us to get better.

293
26:53.798 --> 26:59.626
I hope The Royal Green can be a worthy rival to Goodview.

294
27:00.983 --> 27:03.941
I admire what a strong woman you are, Auntie.

295
27:06.450 --> 27:08.352
You're a strong young woman, too.

296
27:09.701 --> 27:13.239
It'd be a shame if we're only good enough to beat each other.

297
27:13.548 --> 27:16.248
When we could be good enough to leave everyone else behind.

298
27:16.451 --> 27:18.379
There's one thing I believe.

299
27:18.404 --> 27:20.588
Strong women don't have to compete

300
27:20.613 --> 27:22.347
by making another woman fall.

301
27:22.465 --> 27:25.711
You just have to keep pushing yourself to climb higher,

302
27:25.736 --> 27:28.669
without stepping on or hurting other women.

303
27:29.646 --> 27:33.060
If you use the strength you have to create something new,

304
27:33.089 --> 27:37.278
It could be so much more than wondering who's better.

305
27:39.558 --> 27:43.438
Besides, the way we choose to win

306
27:43.463 --> 27:45.083
says a lot about who we are.

307
27:45.993 --> 27:49.617
Even if we win, if we do it dirty,

308
27:50.205 --> 27:52.408
that's how people will remember us.

309
27:54.059 --> 27:56.308
Raising yourself up is harder,

310
27:56.806 --> 28:00.031
but it's more fulfilling than tearing someone else down.

311
28:01.078 --> 28:02.405
That's what I believe.

312
28:09.342 --> 28:11.837
And with that, the competition has officially come to an end.

313
28:11.862 --> 28:13.458
And we have our results.

314
28:13.483 --> 28:14.935
And now,

315
28:14.960 --> 28:18.318
please welcome Pro Venus to the stage to receive her trophy

316
28:18.343 --> 28:23.409
for the All Star Women's Golf Championship.

317
28:26.362 --> 28:28.163
And now, we invite a representative

318
28:28.188 --> 28:29.647
from Goodview Golf Club

319
28:29.671 --> 28:33.087
to receive the certificate granting them hosting rights

320
28:33.112 --> 28:35.350
for the Asian Tour later this year.

321
28:35.375 --> 28:37.375
Oh, my God!

322
28:55.755 --> 28:57.414
I don't blame you for this.

323
29:00.258 --> 29:01.773
I blame myself

324
29:02.388 --> 29:04.896
for trusting a rookie cheater like you.

325
29:05.636 --> 29:06.675
Pathetic.

326
29:21.532 --> 29:24.386
♪ The way you act, I know you're into me ♪

327
29:24.411 --> 29:27.412
♪ That racing heart gives you away so easily ♪

328
29:27.437 --> 29:31.170
♪ But I'll play clueless, just wait and see ♪

329
29:31.195 --> 29:33.088
♪ I wanna hear you say it to me ♪

330
29:33.113 --> 29:35.992
♪ Giving me signs, so why still wait? ♪

331
29:36.017 --> 29:39.454
♪ You know I'm into you, I bet ♪

332
29:39.479 --> 29:44.190
♪ How long will you keep playing so tough? ♪

333
29:44.215 --> 29:45.829
♪ Or should I be the one to call your bluff? ♪

334
29:45.854 --> 29:48.752
♪ Say it, say it. Say "You love me." ♪

335
29:48.777 --> 29:51.763
♪ Call me, call me. Call me "Baby." ♪

336
29:56.386 --> 29:59.335
♪ Giving me signs, so why still wait? ♪

337
29:59.360 --> 30:02.678
♪ You know I'm into you, I bet ♪

338
30:02.703 --> 30:07.389
♪ How long will you keep playing so tough? ♪

339
30:07.414 --> 30:09.385
♪ Or should I be the one to call your bluff? ♪

340
30:11.803 --> 30:16.299
Everyone! Miss Nana is here! Yay!

341
30:27.574 --> 30:33.445
- Vive la vie! Vive la vie! - Vive la vie! Vive la vie!

342
30:53.484 --> 30:55.882
I want to thank everyone so much

343
30:55.907 --> 30:59.433
for helping bring our course back to the top of the industry.

344
31:01.055 --> 31:04.699
I couldn't have done any of this without all of you.

345
31:07.641 --> 31:09.380
Thank you from the bottom of my heart.

346
31:14.499 --> 31:17.356
And thank you, Pro Vee,

347
31:17.381 --> 31:19.610
for bringing home the win for Goodview,

348
31:20.094 --> 31:22.926
and making us an Asian Tour venue.

349
31:26.603 --> 31:28.696
Looks like we've got another round of hard work ahead of us.

350
31:29.698 --> 31:32.405
Hmm... What should we do?

351
31:32.430 --> 31:37.425
Then let me speak for all the Goodview staff.

352
31:39.527 --> 31:42.036
We should be thanking you, too, Miss Nana,

353
31:42.559 --> 31:45.725
for giving us a reason to get up and come to work every morning

354
31:45.750 --> 31:48.766
at Goodview Golf Club.

355
31:49.283 --> 31:51.955
We're so proud that we can tell everyone

356
31:51.980 --> 31:53.980
we work at Goodview.

357
31:55.118 --> 31:57.135
We love you so much, Miss Nana.

358
31:57.175 --> 32:00.544
And thank you for making this place

359
32:00.569 --> 32:03.000
feel like a second home to us.

360
32:03.739 --> 32:05.739
Thank you so much, Miss Nana.

361
32:06.450 --> 32:07.908
We promise, Miss Nana,

362
32:07.933 --> 32:10.028
we'll give it everything we've got.

363
32:10.068 --> 32:11.396
Right, everyone?

364
32:11.420 --> 32:13.087
- That's right! - Absolutely!

365
32:13.399 --> 32:15.257
Vive la vie!

366
32:15.282 --> 32:19.949
- Vive la vie! Vive la vie! - Vive la vie! Vive la vie!

367
32:19.974 --> 32:21.399
Everyone! Everyone!

368
32:21.764 --> 32:24.430
There's one more piece of good news

369
32:24.455 --> 32:26.218
I'd like to share with everyone.

370
32:26.242 --> 32:29.867
Management has just finalized our recent financial results.

371
32:30.894 --> 32:33.205
This month is the first month

372
32:33.230 --> 32:37.145
our course has turned a profit in nearly a year.

373
32:37.170 --> 32:40.092
And this is something we can all be proud of.

374
32:40.117 --> 32:41.856
Oh, my God!

375
32:41.881 --> 32:43.215
Vive la vie!

376
32:43.240 --> 32:48.996
- Vive la vie! Vive la vie! - Vive la vie! Vive la vie!

377
32:49.021 --> 32:52.702
- Vive la vie! Vive la vie! - Vive la vie! Vive la vie!

378
32:52.727 --> 32:55.005
Oh! Your dad is here, Miss Nana!

379
32:56.779 --> 32:58.479
You finally did it, dear.

380
32:58.504 --> 33:00.996
And you did it even faster than I planned.

381
33:01.259 --> 33:02.449
You did great, sweetheart.

382
33:02.474 --> 33:03.928
I'm so proud of you.

383
33:05.166 --> 33:07.510
So Nana can go back to France now, right, Dad?

384
33:07.535 --> 33:10.203
Of course. A promise is a promise.

385
33:10.228 --> 33:14.841
Because now, with the plans, projects, and team you've built,

386
33:14.866 --> 33:20.746
I'm confident our course will continue to turn a profit.

387
33:20.948 --> 33:25.378
And you still have your chemo treatments under my supervision.

388
33:25.403 --> 33:27.132
Hmm. All right, son.

389
33:30.133 --> 33:31.934
I don't have anything to worry about now.

390
33:32.473 --> 33:35.937
From now on, you have my green light.

391
33:35.962 --> 33:39.154
Whatever you want to do, give it your all.

392
33:41.557 --> 33:42.676
Thank you, Dad.

393
33:45.693 --> 33:46.836
I'm proud of you, sweetheart.

394
33:51.735 --> 33:53.012
Come on, clap for her!

395
33:53.037 --> 33:56.139
Why are you all just standing there smiling?

396
33:56.782 --> 34:00.192
With profits like these, maybe we'll get a bonus.

397
34:00.217 --> 34:02.973
You're all standing around like we're having a campfire.

398
34:03.359 --> 34:05.594
- Fantastic! - Come on!

399
34:05.802 --> 34:07.802
Thank you, sweetheart. Thank you, everyone.

400
34:24.559 --> 34:26.356
Why did you call me, Ms. Yupadee?

401
34:27.152 --> 34:28.564
If this is about the competition...

402
34:28.589 --> 34:29.382
Sit down.

403
34:29.706 --> 34:33.305
Or would you rather stand? I won't keep you long.

404
34:49.932 --> 34:51.819
The fertilizer expenses from last month.

405
34:52.644 --> 34:54.024
There are several duplicate claims

406
34:54.049 --> 34:55.318
amounting to hundreds of thousands.

407
34:58.169 --> 35:01.376
The green maintenance expenses don't add up either.

408
35:02.101 --> 35:05.110
And there are equipment expenses

409
35:06.237 --> 35:08.769
and receiving reports for goods never ordered.

410
35:11.239 --> 35:13.635
- It's actually like this... - I don't want to waste my time

411
35:13.660 --> 35:15.955
listening to you make up more stories.

412
35:19.202 --> 35:20.772
I used to think

413
35:21.795 --> 35:24.616
you could be an important player for me,

414
35:24.641 --> 35:26.491
someone who could be useful to me.

415
35:27.181 --> 35:28.355
But I was wrong.

416
35:29.346 --> 35:31.702
You're terrible at playing the villain.

417
35:33.705 --> 35:35.555
And now you're trying to play games with me?

418
35:39.615 --> 35:41.251
You miscalculated, kid.

419
35:44.801 --> 35:47.822
- I can explain. Really. - Don't bother explaining.

420
35:48.659 --> 35:52.900
It'll only make you look worse than you already do.

421
35:55.621 --> 35:57.109
Let me make one thing clear.

422
35:57.638 --> 36:00.877
I'm not as kind as that Nana girl.

423
36:00.902 --> 36:02.472
I'm not letting this slide.

424
36:09.510 --> 36:12.729
You'll remain an employee here for one more day.

425
36:13.821 --> 36:16.511
To settle everything you've stolen.

426
36:17.757 --> 36:21.570
And I expect every last penny

427
36:21.595 --> 36:24.463
to be in my account by tomorrow.

428
36:25.835 --> 36:27.023
Otherwise...

429
36:29.136 --> 36:30.350
I'll press charges.

430
36:31.098 --> 36:32.434
Can I have seven days?

431
36:34.785 --> 36:36.904
I said tomorrow. That means tomorrow.

432
36:40.007 --> 36:41.031
Oh.

433
36:44.491 --> 36:45.970
I almost forgot one thing.

434
36:47.098 --> 36:48.745
Consider this a personal request.

435
36:51.172 --> 36:54.107
Don't tell anyone you ever worked here.

436
36:55.139 --> 36:56.202
I'm embarrassed.

437
37:31.066 --> 37:32.094
I lost.

438
37:33.782 --> 37:34.792
Yes.

439
37:35.610 --> 37:36.817
You lost.

440
37:37.586 --> 37:39.988
A loss is just a loss.

441
37:40.980 --> 37:42.061
It's just a loss, right?

442
37:43.459 --> 37:46.170
But you got something out of it, too.

443
37:47.610 --> 37:48.649
What's that?

444
37:49.206 --> 37:52.176
You got to let go of what was weighing on you.

445
37:53.058 --> 37:55.073
You got your friend Pro Vee back.

446
37:55.567 --> 37:58.184
And now you have me by your side, too.

447
37:59.901 --> 38:00.972
Thank you.

448
38:02.166 --> 38:03.403
For what?

449
38:06.658 --> 38:09.210
I've decided to leave The Royal Green.

450
38:10.571 --> 38:11.745
Why?

451
38:12.450 --> 38:14.026
It's not my place anymore.

452
38:15.758 --> 38:18.560
Then... why not come back to Goodview?

453
38:20.634 --> 38:21.867
I don't think so.

454
38:25.938 --> 38:27.579
I have a bigger dream.

455
38:27.683 --> 38:28.763
What dream?

456
38:28.962 --> 38:31.192
Competing internationally on the LPGA Tour.

457
38:31.816 --> 38:33.054
You're aiming that high?

458
38:33.649 --> 38:35.079
I want to go all the way.

459
38:35.806 --> 38:39.392
Then you'll need a good manager, won't you?

460
38:39.417 --> 38:42.865
From what I know, there's training to plan,

461
38:42.890 --> 38:45.670
tournaments to enter,

462
38:45.940 --> 38:49.252
sponsors to find, not to mention travel arrangements.

463
38:49.277 --> 38:52.367
- And then there's... - Interested in the job?

464
38:53.535 --> 38:55.148
Can I fill out an application?

465
38:55.911 --> 38:58.507
No need. Let's just go straight to the interview.

466
39:04.399 --> 39:06.041
Is this your way of getting back at me?

467
39:07.932 --> 39:09.146
Hmm...

468
39:10.130 --> 39:13.175
Start at 100 and keep subtracting 7.

469
39:15.023 --> 39:21.618
93, 86, 79, 72, 65.

470
39:21.643 --> 39:22.669
That's enough.

471
39:22.694 --> 39:24.257
Next, I'll ask you rapid-fire questions.

472
39:24.282 --> 39:25.092
Go ahead.

473
39:25.116 --> 39:26.323
- One or two? - One.

474
39:26.348 --> 39:28.312
- Bedroom or bathroom? - Bathroom.

475
39:28.630 --> 39:30.930
Living room or in the car?

476
39:32.314 --> 39:33.758
- Left or right? - Right.

477
39:34.150 --> 39:36.230
- Morning or night? - Night.

478
39:37.033 --> 39:39.002
- Black or pink? - Pink.

479
39:39.033 --> 39:40.256
Will you be my girlfriend?

480
39:43.150 --> 39:44.191
Excuse me?

481
39:44.841 --> 39:46.841
Answer me. Will you be my girlfriend?

482
39:50.891 --> 39:51.977
Yes.

483
39:54.216 --> 39:55.549
Are you sure?

484
39:56.463 --> 39:57.784
Absolutely.

485
40:01.073 --> 40:03.795
So, does that mean I got the job?

486
40:06.515 --> 40:09.501
Then I'll ask for my salary in advance.

487
40:19.442 --> 40:21.259
A talented manager like you

488
40:21.775 --> 40:23.775
deserves more than just an advance.

489
40:24.146 --> 40:25.910
You deserve a special bonus, too.

490
40:27.214 --> 40:30.079
♪ But for you, I'd surrender without a fight ♪

491
40:30.104 --> 40:34.305
♪ Just take my hand and hold it tight ♪

492
40:36.188 --> 40:39.326
♪ And walk with me along the way ♪

493
40:39.351 --> 40:41.929
♪ No matter what it takes to win someday ♪

494
40:41.955 --> 40:47.577
♪ Sometimes this tender heart may despair ♪

495
40:47.602 --> 40:50.784
♪ But tell me, why should we care? ♪

496
40:50.809 --> 40:53.207
♪ When all we need is love that's fair ♪

497
40:53.232 --> 40:57.411
♪ In a love we share, no one has to win or lose ♪

498
40:57.436 --> 41:03.600
♪ Even when the storm rolls in or tears fill your eyes ♪

499
41:03.625 --> 41:07.642
♪ Turn around, you'll find me right by your side ♪

500
41:07.667 --> 41:11.265
♪ Even when the whole world turns unkind ♪

501
41:11.290 --> 41:13.595
♪ You won't be left behind ♪

502
41:13.620 --> 41:18.723
♪ Cause I'll always be right here by your side ♪

503
41:24.844 --> 41:25.885
Pro Vee.

504
41:28.445 --> 41:33.088
Everything at the course is going really well.

505
41:33.998 --> 41:36.696
We're starting to turn a profit again.

506
41:36.927 --> 41:40.446
All the projects we've worked on are going according to plan.

507
41:41.530 --> 41:44.649
Dad's started his chemo treatments,

508
41:44.674 --> 41:46.674
and Gus is keeping a close eye on him.

509
41:48.956 --> 41:50.147
And...

510
41:51.623 --> 41:55.337
we have Nut and you to keep everything running.

511
41:55.869 --> 41:58.226
You're both a huge part of what keeps everything going.

512
41:59.878 --> 42:03.089
And the team we've built is stronger than ever.

513
42:03.114 --> 42:05.004
No need for the long introduction, Nana.

514
42:05.590 --> 42:07.261
What's on your mind?

515
42:07.380 --> 42:09.335
Well, Maison Rivanté,

516
42:09.360 --> 42:12.555
the parent company behind major brands around the world,

517
42:12.580 --> 42:14.580
wants me to join their team.

518
42:15.046 --> 42:17.147
As Creative Development.

519
42:18.012 --> 42:20.496
When I applied, I wasn't sure I'd actually get it.

520
42:20.521 --> 42:22.812
I sent them my work so many times.

521
42:23.798 --> 42:26.520
I even sent them my golfwear collection.

522
42:28.110 --> 42:29.343
When would you have to go?

523
42:32.268 --> 42:33.702
That's not what I mean.

524
42:33.727 --> 42:35.905
I haven't decided if I'm going yet.

525
42:35.930 --> 42:38.533
I just wanted to ask what you think, Vee. But if...

526
42:38.558 --> 42:40.274
Think about what you've done for your family,

527
42:40.526 --> 42:45.008
for this course, for all of us, and for me.

528
42:45.842 --> 42:47.685
I think it's time

529
42:47.710 --> 42:49.487
you did something for yourself, too.

530
42:52.193 --> 42:54.346
You're not going to ask me to stay?

531
42:54.505 --> 42:57.696
No, because I know you want to go.

532
42:59.998 --> 43:03.336
When you love someone, you don't hold them back.

533
43:10.403 --> 43:12.729
But they help push each other forward

534
43:12.754 --> 43:14.754
so the person they love can reach their dreams.

535
43:15.506 --> 43:16.949
Just like you did for me.

536
43:18.870 --> 43:21.921
And if you don't go, will you regret it?

537
43:22.993 --> 43:25.405
One day, you might find yourself wondering

538
43:25.430 --> 43:27.024
why you chose to stay.

539
43:29.285 --> 43:32.098
And... what about us?

540
43:33.322 --> 43:36.223
What about us? It'll stay the same.

541
43:36.508 --> 43:37.961
We'll just be farther apart.

542
43:39.068 --> 43:40.957
And we don't have to rush anything.

543
43:48.710 --> 43:52.571
Being apart doesn't mean we have to let go of each other.

544
43:55.310 --> 43:57.341
The distance may grow.

545
43:58.214 --> 44:00.928
But our feelings will never go anywhere.

546
44:02.606 --> 44:04.355
And I'm not waiting, either.

547
44:05.191 --> 44:07.445
I'm just living my life here.

548
44:07.734 --> 44:09.890
And you'll live yours there.

549
44:18.376 --> 44:20.301
Neither of us has to wait for the other.

550
44:21.484 --> 44:23.772
We'll just wait for the right time.

551
44:24.058 --> 44:25.526
Then we'll find each other again.

552
44:33.502 --> 44:35.705
Everyone has their own dreams.

553
44:36.738 --> 44:38.635
I think it's time

554
44:38.660 --> 44:40.778
you followed your own dream, Nana.

555
44:40.928 --> 44:45.293
♪ Do you know which way to go? ♪

556
44:45.980 --> 44:51.096
♪ To get us closer to our goal ♪

557
44:51.121 --> 44:55.964
♪ Together, we'll race toward the line ♪

558
44:56.270 --> 45:00.984
♪ Chasing the dream that's yours and mine ♪

559
45:01.269 --> 45:06.523
♪ In the end, I know we'll make it there ♪

560
45:06.548 --> 45:10.956
♪ Just one rule for you and me to share ♪

561
45:11.532 --> 45:14.660
♪ Promise you'll stay close to me ♪

562
45:14.685 --> 45:17.184
♪ Hold me in your arms so tenderly ♪

563
45:17.209 --> 45:22.809
♪ I've never bowed to anyone in sight ♪

564
45:22.834 --> 45:25.923
♪ But for you, I'd surrender without a fight ♪

565
45:25.948 --> 45:30.555
♪ Just take my hand and hold it tight ♪

566
45:31.778 --> 45:36.118
♪ In a love we share, no one has to win or lose ♪

567
45:43.331 --> 45:46.249
Thank you, everyone, for coming to see me off.

568
45:50.547 --> 45:53.637
Oh, by the way, where's Pro Vee?

569
45:55.855 --> 45:57.783
The team organizing the Asian Tour

570
45:57.808 --> 45:59.382
came to inspect the course.

571
45:59.407 --> 46:01.791
So Pro Vee had to go see what else needs to be done

572
46:01.816 --> 46:03.354
to meet their requirements.

573
46:04.128 --> 46:05.199
Oh.

574
46:05.834 --> 46:08.146
It's okay. Work comes first, after all.

575
46:08.860 --> 46:09.892
I understand.

576
46:11.991 --> 46:13.131
Miss Nana.

577
46:15.946 --> 46:19.289
When you're over there, please take good care of yourself.

578
46:20.990 --> 46:23.292
And if there's anything you want to eat,

579
46:24.269 --> 46:26.080
just message me.

580
46:26.836 --> 46:31.300
I'll have some frozen goodies sent all the way to you.

581
46:32.278 --> 46:37.120
But if you get the chance, come visit me here, okay?

582
46:37.760 --> 46:40.331
I'm definitely going to miss your cooking, Chef Queen.

583
46:42.224 --> 46:43.668
Miss Nana.

584
46:53.675 --> 46:57.024
Congratulations on becoming Pro Jin's new manager, Belle.

585
46:57.460 --> 46:58.804
Pro Jin is incredibly talented.

586
46:58.829 --> 47:01.491
I'm sure she'll go very far.

587
47:04.506 --> 47:06.558
I don't even know how far we'll get.

588
47:07.170 --> 47:08.798
I guess we'll have to wait and see.

589
47:10.111 --> 47:11.945
You'll do great, Belle.

590
47:12.183 --> 47:14.183
But if things don't go according to plan,

591
47:14.208 --> 47:17.170
you're always welcome back here, both of you.

592
47:17.649 --> 47:18.808
Thank you.

593
47:21.825 --> 47:24.832
And don't worry about the course.

594
47:24.857 --> 47:26.435
You can count on all of us.

595
47:30.510 --> 47:32.236
Thank you all again.

596
47:33.093 --> 47:35.707
Please take good care of the course for me.

597
47:36.202 --> 47:38.105
I'll come visit as often as I can.

598
47:39.256 --> 47:43.375
And don't forget to miss your beautiful, brilliant young CEO.

599
47:43.979 --> 47:45.130
Vive la vie!

600
47:46.285 --> 47:47.990
Vive la vie!

601
